Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安  迪爾多夫女士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good morning, Mrs. Deardorff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安  姑娘們\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good morning, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到家了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧  幫你安頓好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, let's get you settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡有21個女孩  她們都和你一樣可愛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have 21 girls here, and they are all just as sweet as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你的床位\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And here is your special place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快走快走  -好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Go, go, go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以把你的衣服放到這下面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can put your clothes down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牙刷可以放到這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And your toothbrush can go right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的個人用品放到這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And any other personal items, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Show her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:06:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來坐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道此時此刻  你只感覺到失去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know that, at this moment, all you're feeling is loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在悲傷讓你情緒低落後\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But after grief brings you low,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈禱和信念會讓你振奮起來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}prayer and faith will lift you high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新找到自己生活的道路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}High enough for you to see a new path for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為  伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think, Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡會擁有一個完全不同的人生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you're going to find a much different life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個或許比以前更好的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A better one than you might have had.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信我們會成為好朋友的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I'm sure that you and I are going to be good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}貝絲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件應該不錯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That should do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舊衣服就燒了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think we'll burn this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換好衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要去個地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have one more stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗格森先生會照顧好你  我們晚餐見\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Fergussen will take good care of you. I'll see you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綠色的最好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The green ones are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,維他命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神奇的維他命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Magic vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的話  就把綠色的留到晚上吃\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I were you, I'd save the green ones up for the night time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然等你希望它們起作用的時候  就沒用了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Otherwise, they turn off right when you need them to turn on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你知道我在說什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, what's your name, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-貝絲  -喬琳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Beth. - Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的父母死了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your mama and daddy dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們臨死前說了什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's the last thing they said to you before they died?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我問了所有人  有一些很有意思的答案\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I ask everybody that. We get some really fun answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉上眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不記得了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天你會的  想起來了就告訴我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Someday, you might. If you do, you let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:35.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綠色的用來紓解情緒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Green's to even your disposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,橘色和棕色的用來增強體質  都吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Orange and brown is for building a strong body. Take 'em both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告訴過你等到睡覺前再吃那些維他命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I thought I told you to wait and take those vitamins at bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據我們所知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Far as we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們每週五都吃這個\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We eat it every Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得都吃光\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta eat every bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他們就會跟迪爾多夫女士告狀\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}or they'll tell Mrs. Deardorff about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不會有人領養你了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and you won't get adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛麗絲  快開門\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Alice, come on, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我找了你整整一個月  -好理由\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- It's taken me a whole month to find you. - Good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管這是怎麼回事  不管你在做什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whatever this is, whatever you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕對你來說也太瘋狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it's nuts, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我沒希望你能理解  -我所理解的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I don't expect you to understand-- - What I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你沒有照顧好你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is you're not taking care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, we'll take...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這很漂亮吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我進去和麗茲聊聊  確保她沒事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me come in and talk to Lizzie. Make sure she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得我會傷害她\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, you think I'd hurt her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在這裡很開心  她屬於這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's happy here. This is where she belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的覺得我們的女兒屬於\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You honestly believe our daughter belongs in a trailer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒郊野外的拖車裡嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}in the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰說她是我們的女兒了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who says she's our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-別這樣  愛麗絲  -她也不喜歡被叫做麗茲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Don't do that, Alice. - And she doesn't like being called Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}《單項表示和對稱表示》\N愛麗絲·哈蒙博士\N康乃爾大學數學系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  愛麗絲  你贏了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, Alice, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再跟你吵下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't fight with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能再追著你跑了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I can't keep chasing you around everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你總是想要逃跑的話\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}if all you do is run away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  保羅\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次我走了  我就再也不會回來了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Once I drive away, I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}數學測驗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈蒙小姐  已經做完了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Miss Harmon, finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把黑板擦拿到地下室\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why don't you take the erasers down
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去把它們洗乾淨吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to the basement and clean them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都是狗雜種\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're all fucking cocksuckers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他們中最大的一個\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and you're the biggest cocksucker of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從來沒見過誰像你這樣喜歡吃肥皂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Never met anyone who liked the taste of soap as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡  哈蒙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where you going, Harmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}洗衣房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安  姑娘們\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good morning, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.31,0:17:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安  迪爾多夫女士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good morning, Mrs. Deardorff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪麗蘇  你真是個幸運的女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mary-Sue, aren't you a lucky girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給斯佩曼夫婦留下了很好的印象\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You really impressed the Spellmans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽說他們的房子很大\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I heard their house is so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來打包行李箱吧  就像我教你的那樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's get your suitcase and pack up. Nicely, like I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  記住  先放襪子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, the socks first, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不公平  她比你來得還晚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That is not fair. She got here after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多數人都會一直留在這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Most of us are lifers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-待在這裡很久了  -別忘了頭箍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Been here a long time. - Don't forget your headband.
