Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當白子走到了王線4  黑棋這麼走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When White moves to king four, Black does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-然後呢  -馬走到KB3\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Then what? - Knight to KB3.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,KB3是什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's KB3?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.38,0:30:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王翼象線第三格  就是我馬的位置\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}King's bishop three, where I just put the knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.47,0:30:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些格子還有名稱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The squares have names?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.45,0:30:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你玩得好  它們就有名字\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you play well, they have names.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.79,0:30:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-教我  -現在不行  我們再下一局\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Show me. - Not now. Let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.63,0:30:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生氣了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒生氣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下棋吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just play.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後你還得學習其他的戰術\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There are other strategies you'll need to learn, down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.68,0:31:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列文費舍變例\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Levenfish Variation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.93,0:31:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,納道爾夫變例\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Najdorf Variation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.13,0:31:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下給我看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.02,0:31:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列文費舍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Levenfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.15,0:32:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,納道爾夫\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Najdorf.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.42,0:32:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一局\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.93,0:32:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  迪爾多夫女士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry, Mrs. Deardorff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.41,0:32:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-媽媽  你猜怎麼樣  -怎麼了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Mom, guess what? - I don't know. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-媽媽  我來第一次例假了  -你知道什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Mom, I've started my first period. - Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.93,0:32:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-這個你沒教過我  -所以呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- That isn't one you taught me. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是那其中的一種\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But is that one of those things,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像西西里防禦一樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}like the Sicilian Defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.22,0:32:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些東西叫"開局"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Those things are called openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.37,0:32:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是那其中的一種嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is that one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.80,0:32:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後翼棄兵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Queen's Gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我執白子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm playing White?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.19,0:33:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始  我們輪流來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}From now on, we take turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.84,0:33:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,象棋本就該這麼下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's the way the game should be played.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.59,0:33:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼我之前不能先走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then, how come I couldn't go first before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下棋吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Play.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.37,0:33:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將軍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.10,0:33:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將殺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.98,0:34:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是威士忌嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is that whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.72,0:34:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.31,0:34:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說出去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《現代象棋開局》\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Modern Chess Openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.49,0:34:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最適合你的書\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's the best book for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.00,0:34:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它會教你想知道的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It will tell you all you wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.77,0:34:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你看書之前  你得知道象棋的符號\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You'll need to learn chess notation before you can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.37,0:34:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些方格的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The names of the squares.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.38,0:34:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在教你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll teach you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.23,0:34:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在夠格了嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Am I good enough now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幾歲了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.68,0:34:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九歲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.52,0:34:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九歲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nine years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.56,0:34:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到十一月就十歲了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll be ten in November.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.47,0:34:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實話告訴你  孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To tell you the truth of it, child...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.22,0:34:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你令人震驚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you're astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.95,0:34:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"沒人聽得見他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Nobody heard him,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.44,0:35:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}史蒂夫·史密斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.74,0:34:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將死之人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the dead man,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.47,0:35:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他仍然在呻吟"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but still he lay moaning."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我不是你們想的那樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"I was much further out than you thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.41,0:35:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在揮手  而是在求救"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and not waving but drowning."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.02,0:35:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"可憐的小伙子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Poor chap,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.78,0:35:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他總喜歡玩耍  然而現在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he always loved larking, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.49,0:35:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he's dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.55,0:35:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"一定是因為他太冷了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"It must have been too cold for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.23,0:35:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心臟才停止了跳動  他們說"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}His heart gave way, they said."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.43,0:35:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Oh, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直很都冷"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it was too cold always."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.99,0:35:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"然後  死人依然呻吟"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Still, the dead one lay moaning."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.45,0:35:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我遠離了我的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"I was much too far out all my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.28,0:35:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在揮手  而是在求救"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and not waving, but drowning."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.73,0:35:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是象棋俱樂部的甘茲先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is Mr. Ganz from the chess club.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.36,0:35:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-象棋俱樂部  -我們在俱樂部裡下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Chess club? - We play at a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.73,0:35:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是高中隊的教練\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm also coach of the high school team.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.28,0:35:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鄧肯高中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Duncan High?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.88,0:36:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想來下一局嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Would you like to play me a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.59,0:36:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你執你選到的顏色\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You play the color you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.78,0:36:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.68,0:36:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列蒂開局\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah, the Réti Opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.64,0:36:59.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這會在三步之內將殺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's mate in three.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.21,0:37:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顯然你知道怎麼下棋  小姑娘\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, you certainly know the game, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.48,0:37:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這裡有隊伍嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you have a team here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.96,0:37:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的女孩  這裡有象棋俱樂部嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The other girls, do they have a chess club?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.86,0:37:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你在哪裡下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, where do you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.40,0:37:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.29,0:37:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏貝先生說你每週日會下幾局\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Shaibel said you play a few games every Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.79,0:37:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這之間你會做什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you do in between?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.86,0:37:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在腦海裡下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I play in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在腦海裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在天花板上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}On the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁我沒忘\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Before I forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.02,0:37:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我給你帶了一個\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I brought you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.71,0:37:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禮物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.69,0:38:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打開看看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go ahead, open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.09,0:38:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分感謝\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.58,0:38:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想再下一局嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you want another game?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.15,0:38:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將軍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貝絲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Beth...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.62,0:39:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把後移到了車線第四格\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've moved my queen to rook four.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將軍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.44,0:39:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,象上前阻塞\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The bishop blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後吃掉了王線的兵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen takes king's pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.73,0:39:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Castles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.36,0:39:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬吃掉了馬\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Knight takes knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.52,0:39:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三步將殺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mate in three.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一個將軍是後\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}First check is with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.70,0:39:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王必須吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The king must take.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後  象會在馬線第五格將軍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then, the bishop checks on knight five...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.80,0:39:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一步就將死了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and it's mate next.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sweet Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.40,0:39:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.27,0:39:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你介意  貝絲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Would you mind, Beth...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我照張照片嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}if I took your picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.76,0:40:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想把你的事告訴象棋俱樂部的孩子們\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'd love to tell the kids in chess club about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站在夏貝先生旁邊怎麼樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How about you stand next to Mr. Shaibel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.81,0:40:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再近點\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.79,0:40:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.66,0:40:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說"皇后"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Say queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皇后\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.75,0:40:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九乘以四等於\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nine times four is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.83,0:40:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}注意禮貌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.94,0:40:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  瑪姬\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hiya, Marge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.97,0:40:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我遲到了  但我在這裡碰到了珍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, I'm sorry I'm late, but I ran into Jean, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.62,0:40:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍  這是埃德·里爾登  我跟你說過的埃德\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Jean, this is Ed Reardon. The Ed I was telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.80,0:40:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你好  -你好嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hello. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.91,0:40:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是傑克·康納\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And this is Jack Connors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.77,0:40:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-珍·貝塞特  來自莫里斯維爾  -你好嗎  珍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Jean Bassett, from over at Morrisville. - How do you do, Jean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.65,0:40:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你好  -你可以坐在這裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hello. - Here, you can sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.15,0:40:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.37,0:41:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想喝點什麼  麥芽酒還是蘇打水\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Would you like something? Malt or soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪爾多夫女士想見你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Mrs. Deardorff wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.34,0:41:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為這是一群很有禮貌的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A well-mannered group, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.44,0:41:09.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會注意到他們的禮貌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You notice their good manners right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.76,0:41:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘茲先生說你是個很有天賦的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Ganz tells me that you are a gifted child.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.31,0:41:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有個不尋常的要求\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He has an unusual request to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.57,0:41:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想讓你去那個高中  在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He would like you to be taken to the high school on...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.54,0:41:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-週四  -週四\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- On Thursday. - On Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.11,0:41:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.02,0:41:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他堅持認為你是一個傑出的象棋棋手\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He maintains that you are a phenomenal chess player.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.63,0:41:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能去到象棋俱樂部下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He would like you to perform for the chess club.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.85,0:41:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們有十幾個成員  我在向迪爾多夫女士提議\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have a dozen members, and I was suggesting to Mrs. Deardorff
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.89,0:41:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你過去和他們所有人同步下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that you come along and play all of them in a simultaneous.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.01,0:41:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同步是什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.23,0:41:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同時\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}At the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們很樂意給女孩們機會\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We like to give our girls a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.22,0:41:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去接觸外面的世界  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for experience outside whenever we can, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.63,0:41:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有點擔心讓伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm a bit wary of letting elizabeth go off
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.10,0:41:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去本地的高中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to the local high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.46,0:41:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會陪她一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, well, I would chaperone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.15,0:41:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會接她  把她帶到學校  再送回來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'd pick her up, take her to the school, then bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.70,0:42:02.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得應該讓別的女士一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was thinking a young lady might also accompany her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.72,0:42:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為你會來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, I assumed that you would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.18,0:42:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為客人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.67,0:42:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.82,0:42:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這裡還有工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I couldn't possibly abandon my duties here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.83,0:42:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那雪莉·芒森怎麼樣\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, what if Shirley Munson,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俱樂部財務主管和我最好的學生之一\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}club treasurer and one of my best students,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.46,0:42:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一起來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}she comes along?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.74,0:42:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得呢  伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you say, Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去高中下象棋嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you want to play chess at the high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.21,0:42:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.20,0:42:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.95,0:42:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就這麼決定了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.24,0:42:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘茲先生  和\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Ganz and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.67,0:42:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-夏洛特  -雪莉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Charlotte? - Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.78,0:42:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪莉  沒錯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shirley, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們會來接你  那就週四午餐後吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They will pick you up, let's say after lunch on Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.98,0:42:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好極了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.24,0:42:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到時候見\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.78,0:43:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.23,0:43:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽說你一直在和我們的管理員下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm told that you've been playing chess with our custodian.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏貝先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}With Mr. Shaibel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.98,0:43:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  女士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.42,0:43:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這很不同尋常  伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is very irregular, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.70,0:43:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去過地下室嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Have you gone to the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.23,0:43:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去過  女士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.16,0:43:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能這麼做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, we can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.23,0:43:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘管梅休因堅信卓越\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As much as Methuen believes in excellence,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.98,0:43:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不能讓你在地下室下棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we can't have you playing chess in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.23,0:43:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想遊戲櫃裡就有象棋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I believe that we have chess sets in the game closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.14,0:43:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會讓弗格森去找找\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll have Fergussen look into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.24,0:43:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣  伊麗莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That'll be all, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在高中注意行為舉止\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mind your manners at the high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.82,0:43:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海倫·迪爾多夫\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Helen Deardorff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.05,0:43:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-少了一個  -就這些\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- There's one missing. - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.04,0:43:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到我了  哈蒙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's my turn, Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.01,0:43:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綠色的去哪了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where are the green ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.26,0:43:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不能再吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't get them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.93,0:43:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們就在那裡  就在你背後\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There they are, right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.52,0:44:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道在哪  哈蒙  但我不會給你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know where they are, Harmon, but I'm not gonna give you any.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.87,0:44:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的州法律  不能再給孩子使用鎮定劑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}New state law. No more tranquilizers for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.23,0:44:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你自己想吧  -哈蒙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Go figure. - Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.43,0:44:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"請汝遠去"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Go thou further off."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.96,0:44:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"與吾道別  聽汝離去"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Bid me farewell, and let me hear thee going."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.77,0:44:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你說什麼  -快走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? - Beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.54,0:45:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗格森給你綠色藥丸了嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did Fergussen give you any green pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.19,0:45:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多給你了嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Extra ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.93,0:45:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有  親愛的  我倒是希望呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, honey, I wish he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.95,0:45:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在州裡在追問他們\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But they got the state after them
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.41,0:45:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿那些藥丸幹什麼用了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for what they've been doing with those pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.26,0:45:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藥還在那\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.31,0:45:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大罐子裡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In the big jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.64,0:45:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.28,0:45:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都沒注意過\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I ain't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.69,0:45:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有戒斷症狀嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're having withdrawal symptoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.45,0:45:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.42,0:45:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.44,0:45:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戒斷就像是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Withdrawal, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.68,0:45:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不好  你最近脾氣急躁嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know, you getting edgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.70,0:45:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  你有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧著吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.73,0:45:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下去幾天會有好多\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}there's gonna be some jumpy orphans
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.20,0:45:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脾氣暴躁的孤兒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}around here the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.15,0:46:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈蒙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.64,0:46:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還好嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.16,0:46:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你用王翼棄兵開局嗎  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Do you play the King's Gambit? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.70,0:46:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的最愛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.02,0:46:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道象棋的起源比跳棋還早嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know chess is older than checkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.36,0:46:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不知道  -早了大概四百年\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - By, like, 400 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.58,0:46:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.89,0:46:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能跟貝絲說句話嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can I talk to Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.65,0:46:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-就一小會  祝她好運  -行  去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Just for a second, wish her luck. - Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.64,0:46:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好運\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.58,0:47:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}科學實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.58,0:47:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}歡迎貝絲·哈蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.58,0:48:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都找位置坐下  安靜點\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take your seats and be quiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.54,0:48:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查爾斯·利維用一號棋盤\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Charles Levy will take board number one
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.34,0:48:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他是我們中最厲害的棋手\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}since he's our top player.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人隨便坐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The rest of you can sit where you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下棋時不准說話\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There will be no talking during play.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在開始嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do I start now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.60,0:48:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從一號棋盤開始\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}With board number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.86,0:48:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後我去下一個棋盤嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And then I go on to the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.63,0:48:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.25,0:49:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你給所有棋盤開局後他們才能接著下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They can't respond until you've opened at every board.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.95,0:49:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我意外的是  他們下得太爛了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What surprised me was how bad they played.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.19,0:49:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的落後兵到處都是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They left backward pawns all over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.19,0:49:26.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)\fs14\b0\bord0\shad0}掉在最後的得不到其它兵保護的兵
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.05,0:49:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他們的棋子都等著被捉雙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and their pieces were wide open for forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.05,0:49:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)\fs14\b0\bord0\shad0}一個棋子同時攻擊敵方兩個棋子或兵的戰術運子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.21,0:50:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人嘗試了愚蠢的將殺進攻\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A few of them tried stupid mating attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.93,0:50:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我都解決了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I took care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.06,0:50:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個叫查爾斯·利維的男孩\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This boy, Charles Levy,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.60,0:50:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是最厲害的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}he was supposed to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.00,0:50:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我15步就把他的棋子困住了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I had his pieces tied up in 15 moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.49,0:50:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再用6步將死了他  用車馬組合\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mated him in six more, with a knight-rook combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.30,0:50:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘茲先生說我一共用了1小時20分\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mr. Ganz told me I beat them all
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.28,0:50:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打敗了他們所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}in an hour and 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.29,0:50:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺很好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.65,0:50:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前從沒贏過什麼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've never won anything before.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.63,0:50:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你該回去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.06,0:50:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的給你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can have the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.37,0:51:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喬琳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.78,0:51:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還有維他命嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you have any more vitamins?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.19,0:51:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼沒禮貌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.03,0:51:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是薩曼莎  她剛來\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is Samantha. She just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.29,0:51:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你連一顆都沒了嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Haven't you got even just one?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.83,0:51:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交流會怎麼樣  你表現地好嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How'd the exhibit go? You do okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-還行  但我需要  -我不想聽\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Fine, but I need-- - I don't want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.85,0:51:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  薩曼莎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hello, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(380,235)\fs14\b0\bord0\shad0}背景音為電影《聖袍千秋》
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  摒棄他  讓民眾知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jesus. Renounce him, so all can hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.06,0:52:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能摒棄他  陛下  你也不行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I cannot renounce him, sire. Nor can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.67,0:52:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的王  也是您的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He is my king and yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.73,0:52:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是上帝的兒子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He is the son of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.42,0:52:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你的答案嗎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And that is your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.30,0:52:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  陛下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加里奧護民官\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tribune Gallio,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.55,0:52:37.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們裁定你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we decree that you be
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.21,0:52:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立即被押解宮殿箭場\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}taken immediately to the palace archery field
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.90,0:52:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因叛國罪處以死刑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and put to death for high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.59,0:52:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  黛安娜  沒有正當理由\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Diana. No, there's no reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.02,0:52:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下  馬塞勒斯是我揀選的丈夫\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sire, Marcellus is my chosen husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.81,0:52:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我請求跟他一同受罰\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I ask to go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.26,0:52:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去廁所\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.83,0:52:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.87,0:53:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下  你沒有被審判\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stand back! You're not on trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.97,0:53:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有你的罪證\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's no evidence against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能讓您歡喜  陛下  我可以提供罪狀\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then if it please you, sire, I'll provide evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.82,0:53:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叛徒  反國家的共謀者\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A traitor! And a conspirator against the state!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.30,0:53:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  馬塞勒斯不是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, not Marcellus!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.71,0:53:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他沒有臣服於你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's why he hasn't come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.94,0:53:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}甘菊不能進眼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.37,0:53:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.26,0:53:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你竟敢玷汙如此優良血統\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But in you, noble blood has turned to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.28,0:53:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的惡行另羅馬墮落腐敗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You corrupt Rome with your spite and malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.44,0:53:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-停下  住口  -你應該做凱撒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Stop! Stop it! - You should be Caesar!
