Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.54,0:53:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至於我  我已經找到另一個君王\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As for me, I have found another king.
